        "explanation": "Doctor immediately sets the risk frame and gives explicit actionable items for temperature and observation.",
        "quote": "体温一定要量。新生儿不会说话，发热或体温偏低都可能是严重问题的信号。建议每天至少量2-3次"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00057",
        "explanation": "Doctor translates the mother's reading of the discharge diagnosis into a clear, evidence-based explanation of neonatal brain infarction and pneumonia, and links it to the observation plan.",
        "quote": "这绝对不等于“一定会有后遗症”。新生儿的脑子和大人不一样，可塑性非常强。很多小面积的梗死，随着宝宝长大，周围正常的脑细胞是可以慢慢代偿、重新建立连接的"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00057",
        "explanation": "Doctor uses the mother's read-back of the discharge summary to ground the plan, and later, at lite_evt_00153, re-confirms the same key points without losing any thread.",
        "quote": "出院小结上写他“吸吮佳、没有抽搐、精神反应好”，这说明目前他的神经功能表现是好的"
      }
    ],
