        "event_id": "lite_evt_00057",
        "explanation": "Doctor converts the general advice into a concrete shift schedule and practical, low-burden observation method.",
        "quote": "轮流值班：你和爸爸商量好，每人盯3个小时，另一个人必须去睡。比如你先睡到凌晨1点，让爸爸看着；1点后你起来换他。"
      }
    ]
  },
