          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides clear, immediate emergency action for any red flag.",
          "quote": "只要出现上面任何一条，不要等，直接去医院。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor gave clear, time-sensitive instructions for immediate emergency evaluation if any red flag was present; later, at lite_evt_00057, lite_evt_00126, and others, he reinforced this with specific thresholds.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
