          "event_id": "lite_evt_00057",
          "explanation": "Doctor uses the mother's verbatim reading of the discharge summary to ground the plan.",
          "quote": "“出院诊断”这里写的是：新生儿脑梗死、新生儿肺炎、低蛋白血症、维生素D缺乏症。后面还有心脏的几个，我看着像“动脉导管未闭”“卵圆孔未闭”，还有什么“三尖瓣反流”还是“二尖瓣反流”，这个我不太会看。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly asked the mother to read the discharge summary and used the retrieved records to verify the diagnoses, medications, and follow-up, not relying solely on the mother's memory.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_record_or_discharge_instruction_grounding",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00057",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides an executable, low-burden observation plan with specific targets.",
          "quote": "喂奶时观察：继续每3小时左右喂一次奶（大概70ml）。喂奶的时候就是你们最好的观察时间…睡觉时怎么看：每隔大概半小时到一小时，看一眼宝宝的脸色是不是红润的、胸口起伏是不是平稳的、有没有异常的抖动"
        }
