          "quote": "肺炎没带抗生素回家正常吗？是正常的。新生儿肺炎如果在住院期间已经用够了疗程的静脉抗生素，出院时感染指标控制住了、呼吸平稳、不发烧，就不需要再带口服抗生素回家。乱吃反而不好。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly addressed the medication confusion, explained why no oral antibiotics were needed, and emphasized not to self-administer, while also covering follow-up and vaccine/screening checks.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
